3. Music

Music has role slots too.

Template:

* tension
* release
* motif
* variation
* expectation
* disruption
* cadence
* return

Mad Lib:

Introduce [motif], develop it through [variation process], create [tension type], interrupt with [contrast], then resolve through [cadential form].

