Useful distinctions for the repo

I’d preserve these terms because they help future reconstruction:

Slot

A structural placeholder.

Filler / Embodiment

What currently occupies the slot.

Constraint

What kinds of fillers are valid.

Role

The function the slot serves in the structure.

Topology

How slots relate.

Template

A structured arrangement of slots and constraints.

Instantiation

A specific filled-out example.

Transformation

A way of changing either the fillers or the template.

Invariant

What survives many instantiations.

Operator

A template or transformation reliable enough to use deliberately.

