Canonical Pantheon form

You could almost express the whole thing as:

Slots + Constraints + Relations + Fillers + Dynamics \rightarrow Meaningful\ System

And then:

Many\ Instantiations \rightarrow Extract\ Invariants \rightarrow Reusable\ Operator

That applies to:

* stories
* models
* arguments
* songs
* experiments
* business systems
* self-reflection
* interfaces

