Short repo-ready checksum

If I compress it:

Mad Libs are the toy form of a general abstraction engine. A template defines structural slots, roles, constraints, and relations. Specific embodiments fill those slots to generate a concrete artifact or system. Pantheon generalizes this into a cross-domain method: infer templates from artifacts, extract invariants, compare topologies across domains, and reinstantiate the resulting structures in science, story, music, finance, art, and metacognition. Repeatedly successful templates become operators.

